    <briefdescription>
<para>When the GSYM file&apos;s endianness doesn&apos;t match the host system then we must decode all data structures that need to be swapped into local storage and set point the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_array_ref" kindref="compound">ArrayRef</ref> objects above to these swapped copies. </para>
